      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KOOKY (3) has been very good at both appearances this prep. Scored first up at this track then finished 2.25 metres from the winner in second over 1609m at this track at the latest run eight days ago. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role. VINCENT THE THIRD (1) turned in a much better run when second up at his latest appearance, finishing third over 1680m at Launceston. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Won't find this any harder and he can find the winners' circle. MISS VINCENTINA (2) is in the mix at her first run since finishing fifth over 1609m at this track nine weeks ago. MAJOR SCOTTY (4) is worth some thought despite his last-start 12th over 2090m at this track on October 31.",
